# Reusable Caddy snippet — LDAP-bound app (Jellyfin)
#
# Usage:
#   import ldap-app jellyfin 8096
#
# Same shape as oidc-app from Caddy's perspective: plain reverse proxy.
# The LDAP traffic flows app -> glauth-kratos bridge (co-located in pod
# in production), not through Caddy. Caddy never sees LDAP.

(ldap-app) {
	tls {
		dns cloudflare {env.CF_API_TOKEN}
	}
	reverse_proxy {args[0]}:{args[1]}
}
